{"author":{"id":"038d65070aa747b6bc9d50939fa697ec871a40ed259db54429b255bbef2581d6"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1792705121,"nonce":"BehZCeeumUyl2rGaDkPbKlKLJXE=","title":"Use member project contexts for Rayzor workspaces","message":"Inspection of the real examples/demo-workspace/rayzor.toml shows a separate language-service gap. RayDE ProjectFile treats a workspace-only manifest as one project with a default root class path, while Rayzor lsp/src/context.rs::manifest_class_paths handles SingleProject and returns an empty list for Workspace. The workspace settings form supports members and shared cache, but opening a member file from the workspace root does not select that member's class paths/defines. Resolve per-document member configuration rather than merging unrelated members' compiler settings. Reproduce with examples/demo-workspace/app/src/Main.hx importing the mathlib member. No Rayzor source changes made in this sample-check task.","files":null}]}